        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Trey Anastasio, Sarah Nixey\n- Music Groups and Projects: Phish, Trey Anastasio Band, Black Box Recorder, Evenings with Trey Anastasio\n- Organizations: New York Philharmonic, Los Angeles Philharmonic, Atlanta Symphony Orchestra, Baltimore Symphony, Pittsburgh Symphony, Colorado Symphony\n- Products: The Horseshoe Curve\n\nFacts:\n- Trey Anastasio was born on September 30, 1964.\n- Sarah Nixey was born on December 21, 1973, in Dorset, England.\n- Trey Anastasio is an American guitarist, composer, and vocalist noted for his work with Phish and for his solo career.\n- Trey Anastasio's solo career includes the Trey Anastasio Band and the orchestral project Evenings with Trey Anastasio.\n- Evenings with Trey Anastasio was performed with the New York Philharmonic, the Los Angeles Philharmonic, the Atlanta Symphony Orchestra, the Baltimore Symphony, the Pittsburgh Symphony, and the Colorado Symphony.\n- Sarah Nixey is a British singer-songwriter best known as the vocalist in Black Box Recorder.\n- The Horseshoe Curve is Trey Anastasio's sixth studio album.",
